{{See also|Night Saver}}
The '''Day Saver''' is an {{Uncommon}} block that is unlocked at {{Coll|Nether Quartz 3|img = t}}. It can be used to unlock the Island Time menu on a {{Zone|Private Island}} or {{Zone|The Garden}} to make it always day time on the island.

