== Usage ==
A '''Day Saver''' followed by a {{Item|Night Saver}} can be used to unlock the Island Time menu on a {{zone|Private Island}} or {{zone|The Garden}}, after which there will be an option to set the time in one hour increments, as well as whether to freeze the time.

It prevents mobs that generate naturally at night from spawning. However, if it's activated during the night, mobs will briefly keep spawning; exiting and re-entering the island solves this.{{confirm}}<!-- Is this still the case? -->

It can be used with a {{Item|Solar Panel}} to constantly grant [[Minions]] {{Green|+25%}} speed, similarly to an {{Item|Enchanted Lava Bucket}}. However, the Day Saver doesn't work when the player is offline, so they won't receive the benefits of the Solar Panel then.

== Interface ==
The '''Day Saver''' originally featured its own interface when placed down. However, after the 0.19.9 update, this was merged with the [[Night Saver]] and replaced by the Island Time menu found under the Island Properties menu on the {{Zone|Private Island}} or within the [[Desk (The Garden)|Desk]] inside {{Zone|The Garden}}
{{/UI}}

